dparents and 18,000$ a year private school.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2877173320799364654/comments/default/6318040683523193267'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2877173320799364654/comments/default/6318040683523193267'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/michael-reichert-and-road-pirates-of.html?showComment=1355060414344#c6318040683523193267' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/michael-reichert-and-road-pirates-of.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2877173320799364654' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/2877173320799364654' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-348426450"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 9, 2012 at 6:40 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6330524140344292669</id><published>2012-12-08T19:48:29.156-07:00</published><updated>2012-12-08T19:48:29.156-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Forget  bringing  back the Geneva Bible I&amp;#39;d sa...</title><content type='html'>Forget  bringing  back the Geneva Bible I&amp;#39;d say its time to bring back the Guillotine </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2877173320799364654/comments/default/6330524140344292669'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2877173320799364654/comments/default/6330524140344292669'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/michael-reichert-and-road-pirates-of.html?showComment=1355021309156#c6330524140344292669' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/michael-reichert-and-road-pirates-of.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2877173320799364654' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/2877173320799364654' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1068244930"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 8, 2012 at 7:48 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1325525277445446462</id><published>2012-12-08T06:42:29.945-07:00</published><updated>2012-12-08T06:42:29.945-07:00</updated><title type='text'>We need to bring back the Geneva Bible.&#xa;&#xa;The King ...</title><content type='html'>We need to bring back the Geneva Bible.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The King James Bible was commissioned by guess who: &lt;b&gt;King&lt;/b&gt; James.&lt;br /&gt;I love the King James Bible but it waters down the truth about&lt;br /&gt;obeisance to state power. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;It was the Geneva Bible that prompted the English revolution.&lt;br /&gt;Time to bring it back and set &amp;quot;evangelical&amp;quot; Christians back on the right track.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2877173320799364654/comments/default/1325525277445446462'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/2877173320799364654/comments/default/1325525277445446462'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2012/12/michael-reichert-and-road-pirates-of.html?showComment=1354974149945#c1325525277